@prefix gmeow:  <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/> .
@prefix skos:   <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#> .
@prefix semapv: <https://w3id.org/semapv/vocab/> .
@prefix schema: <https://schema.org/> .

# Term equivalences for the cognition domain — GMEOW authoring source.
# Compiled to mappings/gmeow-cognition.sssom.tsv by `gmeow compile-mappings`.

gmeow:mapsetCognition a gmeow:MappingSet ;
    gmeow:sssomFile "gmeow-cognition.sssom.tsv" ;
    gmeow:setId "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/mappings/cognition" ;
    gmeow:license "https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/" ;
    gmeow:setComment "Cognition alignments — the knowledge spectrum and its reified tier. schema.org offers a single flat knowsAbout; GMEOW's four-level spectrum down-collapses to it (lossy), and a bare schema:knowsAbout lifts to the eponymous gmeow:knowsAbout level (its honest floor — depth is never inferred from a flat edge). The reified gmeow:KnowledgeProficiency reads its depth on a gmeow:ProficiencyScale: the native gmeow:scaleKnowledgeDepth (the four gmeow:KnowledgeLevel ordinals) is the default, while Bloom's revised taxonomy (gmeow:scaleBloomRevised), SOLO (gmeow:scaleSOLO), and Dreyfus (gmeow:scaleDreyfus, languages) are reusable alternates — NO canonical framework is enforced (Principle 6). The cross-framework band correspondence is the documented alignment ledger in docs.md, never an OWL axiom (cognition ⊥ expertise; the knows-axis and the can-do axis are never silently bridged, Principle 9)." .

# schema:knowsAbout IS the gmeow:knowsAbout level of the spectrum: an agent has
# knowledge of a subject. exactMatch (not closeMatch) so a source schema:knowsAbout
# lifts to an ASSERTED gmeow:knowsAbout fact (the QID-anchored subject preserved),
# outranking the narrower gmeow:hasSkill→schema:knowsAbout projection collision.
gmeow:eqCognition001 a gmeow:TermEquivalence ;
    gmeow:alignSubject gmeow:knowsAbout ;
    gmeow:alignPredicate skos:exactMatch ;
    gmeow:alignObject schema:knowsAbout ;
    gmeow:justification semapv:ManualMappingCuration ;
    gmeow:confidence 0.95 ;
    gmeow:comment "schema:knowsAbout — an agent's knowledge of a subject — is exactly the gmeow:knowsAbout level of the four-level knowledge spectrum; the finer levels (understands, hasMastered) are GMEOW enrichment that down-collapses to this flat target." ;
    gmeow:sssomFile "gmeow-cognition.sssom.tsv" .
